OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold, partly cloudy start
OL,6,Fwith showers in the north and along
OL,7,Fthe coast. Generally clearing up
OL,8,Fthrough the day with any shower
OL,9,Fbecoming limited to the coastal
OL,10,Ffringe. Temperatures below average
OL,11,Faway from the coast. Breezy in places.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA clear and dry evening and
OL,14,Fnight is expected for most areas
OL,15,Fallowing a widespread frost to
OL,16,Fdevelop. The odd mist and fog patch is
OL,17,Fpossible. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
