OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA cold and clear start to
OL,6,Fthe day for most areas. Remaining cold
OL,7,Ffor most areas away from the coast
OL,8,Fdespite the sunshine. Light winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,11,FRemaining cold through Sunday and
OL,12,FMonday, but cloudier and with a slight
OL,13,Frisk of an isolated shower. Turning
OL,14,Fbreezier with potential for rain and
OL,15,Fhill snow on Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
